## SESSION A: Complete Summary

All 8 items successfully implemented and verified with `npm run build` passing.

### A1. "Requiescat in pace" button click fix
- Changed `GraveOverlay.triggerExit()` to call `onExitCallback()` directly instead of dispatching DOM event
- Added `touchend` listener for mobile support
- Set button `touch-action: manipulation` to prevent double-tap zoom
- Updated overlay `pointer-events: all` to ensure button receives clicks
- **Result:** Button click and tap both exit the overlay correctly

### A2. World bounds and explorable graveyard
- Added `physics.world.setBounds(0, 0, WORLD_W, WORLD_H)` in `create()`
- Extended `PATH_RECTS` with outer ring paths connecting all 40 graves:
  - Row 1 full-width path (y ≈ 350–410)
  - Rows 3 & 4 left/right wing paths with vertical connectors
  - Lower terrace path (y ≈ 1580)
  - Mid-left/mid-right cross-spurs for interior connectivity
- **Result:** All 40 graves reachable; wizard can walk entire perimeter and interior network

### A3. Grounding: shadows and decals
- Replaced flat ellipse shadows with image-based contact + cast shadows:
  - Contact shadow: `shadow_contact` (64×24, alpha 0.6)
  - Cast shadow: `shadow_cast` (96×40, alpha 0.25, offset +0.25×width, +3 px y)
- Applied to: tombstones (Tombstone.ts), trees, pumpkins, wizard
- Grave mounds: `decal_grave_mound` at 75–90% scale for ~70% decorative + all resurrectable graves
- Ground decals: ~375 procedurally placed with seeded RNG (mulberry32(1031)):
  - Grass tufts (150), flowers (30), dirt patches (28), pebbles (24), leaf litter (30), etc.
  - Avoid paths (except pebbles/leaf_litter), avoid 24 px radius of graves & plaza centre
  - Small tint jitter toward navy (#c8d4e8) for moonlit palette
- **Result:** No floating objects; complete grounding with rich ground variation; consistent seeded placement

### A4. Wizard origin and bob
- Set wizard origin to `(0.5, 61/64)` so boots touch ground (Movicx sprite has 3 transparent rows)
- Adjusted physics body offset to `20, 46` to align with new origin
- Added walk bob: 1 px vertical sine wave synced to walk cycle (500 ms period)
- Shadow scales 0.92 ↔ 1.0 in sync with bob
- Idle: no bob, shadow normal scale
- **Result:** Wizard appears grounded; subtle walk animation improvement

### A5. Tree trunk collision
- Added static collision group